//Overskirt: black panels lined in orange, open at the front and draped up at the edges
# Overskirt: s from the waist down, q around from her right front edge, over the back, to her left
# front edge. The opening widens downward (oth) and the hem lifts near the opening (ozh).
oth(s)=0.28+0.44*s
ophi(s,q)=oth(s)+(2*pi-2*oth(s))*q
ozh(f)=1.55+2.2*max(0,cos(f))^2
oz(s,f)=7.95-(7.95-ozh(f))*s
orad(s,f)=(sa((8.4-oz(s,f))/7.05)+0.07)*(1+0.028*s*sin(9*f))
